  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Book Book Trade 2018 - Book Trade 2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationella Torget Bok- Biblioteksm&#xe4;ssan 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationella Torget p&#xe5; bokm&#xe4;ssan i G&#xf6;teborg syftar till att st&#xf6;dja den svenska regeringens strategi f&#xf6;r informations- och kommunikationsverksamhet. Genom att n&#xe4;rvara p&#xe5; Internationella Torget med en monter bidrar Sida till diskussionen om globala utvecklingsfr&#xe5;gor och tydligg&#xf6;ra bist&#xe5;ndets resultat, gentemot allm&#xe4;nheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative Internationella Torget (International Square) at Gothenburg Book Fair aims to support the Swedish government&apos;s  strategy for information and communication activities. By attending Internationella Torget and having a stand on site, Sida contributes to the discussion of global development issues and sharing of information about Swedish development cooperation and its results to the public.</narrative>
  </description>
